+## Research Delegation
+
+Research tangents that arise mid-review — dispatch them via `/research` and keep the review tight.
+
+**Definition of research:** Pure information retrieval, audit, tradeoff analysis, codebase
+survey, or exploration — anything that doesn't directly contribute to the current PR verdict.
+
+**Threshold:** If a question or investigation would take > ~10 turns and isn't needed to
+determine the PR's merge-readiness, stop and dispatch via `/research` instead.
+
+**Action:** Invoke `/research "<the research question>"` to dispatch it to an available agent.
+Resume the PR review immediately — don't wait for research results. Note in the review comment
+that a research dispatch was sent for the tangential question.
